OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy, gloomy day for most.
OL,6,FWales seeing rain first thing, then
OL,7,Feastern England later. Drizzly showers
OL,8,Fin the northeast, and heavy showers in
OL,9,Fthe far southwest. Feeling chilly but
OL,10,Fwith much lighter winds than recent
OL,11,Fdays.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDamp for parts of eastern
OL,14,FEngland, the Midlands and later into
OL,15,Fnorthern England. Heavy showers still
OL,16,Fpersisting in the far southwest.
OL,17,FElsewhere, cloudy with a few drizzly
OL,18,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
