OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny early mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches slowly clearing then brighter
OL,7,Fspells developing for parts of England
OL,8,Fand Wales by the afternoon. Dull and
OL,9,Fdamp for northeastern England and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
